{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow\/refresh(onSuccess:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/snowplowtracker\/snowplow\/refresh(onsuccess:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@objc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"refresh","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"onSuccess","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ([","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]?, ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/ConfigurationState","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@E@SPConfigurationState","text":"ConfigurationState","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"onSuccess","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The callback called when a configuration (cached or downloaded) is set It passes the list of the namespaces associated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the created trackers."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The trackers configuration is automatically download from the endpoint indicated in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RemoteConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"previously used to setup the trackers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The method is asynchronous and you can receive the list of the created trackers in the callbacks once the trackers are created.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The downloaded configuration updates the cached one only if the configuration version is greater than the cached one.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Otherwise the cached one is kept and the callback is not called.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: The EventStore will persist all the events that have been tracked but not yet sent."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Those events are attached to the namespace."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If the tracker is removed or the app relaunched with a different namespace, those events can’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be sent to the collector and they remain in a zombie state inside the EventStore."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To remove all the zombie events you can call an internal method "},{"code":"removeUnsentEventsExceptForNamespaces","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"code":"SPSQLEventStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which will delete all the EventStores instanced with namespaces not listed in the passed list."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker","doc:\/\/SnowplowTracker\/documentation\/SnowplowTracker\/Snowplow"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"c:@M@SnowplowTracker@objc(cs)SPSnowplow(cm)refreshOnSuccess:","roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"SnowplowTracker"}],"title":"refresh(onSuccess:)","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"refresh","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"onSuccess","kind":"externalP